<title>USA: Aristech to study 3rd polypropylene unit.</title>
<headline>Aristech to study 3rd polypropylene unit.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Corp unit Aristech Chemical Corp said on Friday it would conduct a preliminary engineering study for a third polypropylene unit which would increase its annual polpropylene capacity to 615,000 metric tons.</p>
<p>The producer and marketer for chemical and polymer products said it would work with an engineering and construction firm to conduct a study for a unit at its LaPorte, Texas site.</p>
</text>
